# ProcMon Recipe: network_only
#
# Text descriptor (see file_io_only.pmcx header for reconstruction
# instructions).
#
# Recipe contract:
# - Capture only TCP* / UDP* operations as ProcMon sees them via the
#   network filter driver.
# - ProcMon does not capture kernel-only TCP (drivers talking via
#   NDIS/WSK without crossing the AFD layer). For that, use ETW /
#   pktmon -- not this recipe.

[Includes]
Operation contains TCP Connect
Operation contains TCP Disconnect
Operation contains TCP Send
Operation contains TCP Receive
Operation contains TCP Accept
Operation contains TCP Reconnect
Operation contains TCP Retransmit
Operation contains TCP TCPCopy
Operation contains UDP Send
Operation contains UDP Receive

[Excludes]
Operation contains CreateFile
Operation contains ReadFile
Operation contains WriteFile
Operation contains CloseFile
Operation contains RegQuery
Operation contains RegOpenKey
Operation contains RegCloseKey
Operation contains Process Create
Operation contains Process Exit
Operation contains Thread Create
Operation contains Thread Exit
Operation contains Process Profiling

[Capture]
BackingFile suggestion: C:\procmon\network.pml
Runtime suggestion: 60 seconds
